   "titulo": "Get used to it.",
   "texto": [
    "**Привыкнуть к** (get used to) goes with dative: **привыкнуть к шуму** (get used to noise). In the past, **привык** (masculine) and **привыкла** (feminine): **Я привык к городу** (I got used to the city).",
    "In the future, **привыкну** (I will get used to it): **Я привыкну** (I will get used to it)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Tired of something",
   "texto": [
    "**Надоесть** (tired, bored) takes the person in dativa and what is tired in the subject: **Мне надоел шум** (the noise has tired me). The verb matches what is tired: **надоел** (masculine), **надоела** (feminine), **надоело** (neutral).",
    "**с одной стороны... с другой стороны...** is used to talk about pros and cons (on the one hand... on the other)."
